  <HediffDef>
    <defName>YR_LivingCoatCombatGasDuration</defName>
    <label>정제된 전투용 최음가스 투여</label>
    <description>사목의 전투용 가스가 작용 중입니다. 효과가 끝나면 약 1일 동안 후유증이 남습니다.</description>
    <hediffClass>YuranLivingCoat.CombatGasDuration</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <scenarioCanAdd>false</scenarioCanAdd>
    <comps>
      <li Class="HediffCompProperties_Disappears">
        <disappearsAfterTicks>18000</disappearsAfterTicks>
        <showRemainingTime>true</showRemainingTime>
      </li>
    </comps>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>YR_LivingCoatRefinedGasAftereffect</defName>
    <label>정제 가스 후유증</label>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <description>전투용 가스 투여가 끝난 뒤 약 1일 동안 후유증이 단계적으로 나타납니다.</description>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.392, 0.678, 0.737)</defaultLabelColor>
    <scenarioCanAdd>false</scenarioCanAdd>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <initialSeverity>1</initialSeverity>
    <isBad>true</isBad>
    <comps>
      <li Class="HediffCompProperties_SeverityPerDay">
        <severityPerDay>-1</severityPerDay>
      </li>
      <li Class="YR_RJW.HediffCompProperties_EggVibrator_Maker">
        <ticks>600</ticks>
        <rand>80</rand>
        <hediffDef>YR_TentacleWiggle_Hediff</hediffDef>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <statFactors>
          <IncomingDamageFactor>1.5</IncomingDamageFactor>
        </statFactors>
        <painFactor>3</painFactor>
        <capMods>
          <li>
            <capacity>Manipulation</capacity>
            <setMax>0</setMax>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Moving</capacity>
            <setMax>0</setMax>
          </li>
        </capMods>
      </li>
      <li>
        <minSeverity>0.66666</minSeverity>
        <statFactors>
          <IncomingDamageFactor>1.2</IncomingDamageFactor>
        </statFactors>
        <painFactor>3</painFactor>
        <capMods>
          <li>
            <capacity>Manipulation</capacity>
            <postFactor>0.75</postFactor>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Moving</capacity>
            <postFactor>0.75</postFactor>
          </li>
        </capMods>
      </li>
      <li>
        <minSeverity>0.8</minSeverity>
        <statFactors>
          <IncomingDamageFactor>1.1</IncomingDamageFactor>
        </statFactors>
        <painFactor>3</painFactor>
        <capMods>
          <li>
            <capacity>Manipulation</capacity>
            <postFactor>0.9</postFactor>
          </li>
          <li>
            <capacity>Moving</capacity>
            <postFactor>0.9</postFactor>
          </li>
        </capMods>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>YR_LivingCoatRefinedGasFatigue</defName>
    <label>정제 가스 대사 부담</label>
    <description>정제 가스가 끝난 뒤 2일간 허기와 수면 게이지가 30% 빠르게 줄어듭니다.</description>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <isBad>true</isBad>
    <scenarioCanAdd>false</scenarioCanAdd>
    <comps>
      <li Class="HediffCompProperties_Disappears">
        <disappearsAfterTicks>120000</disappearsAfterTicks>
        <showRemainingTime>true</showRemainingTime>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <hungerRateFactor>1.3</hungerRateFactor>
        <restFallFactor>1.3</restFallFactor>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <RecipeDef MayRequire="SutSutMan.YRHentaiPrime">
